<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahrend 1996 net in line with forecast.</title>
<headline>Ahrend 1996 net in line with forecast.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.42 vs   4.43</p>
<p>    Net profit			    41.8  vs  33.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.55</p>
<p>    Turnover			     748.6  vs 689.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    62.8  vs  51.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Office equipment group Koninklijke Ahrend NV said in January it expected a 1996 net profit of about 41.8 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
